WEBVTT

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:03.520
We finally made it to Opharimon's castle.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.160
There we met Nefertimon, the protector of the palace.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.560
Too bad she didn't know where the key to protecting it was.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.240
After a night of fruitless searching,

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.600
the unified kids were forced to face those rotten royals.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.930
It turns out Nefertimon was the key.

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.370
Oh, they tried their best,

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.450
but the royal knights were just too much for them,

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:23.050
and they succeeded in scanning the castle and reviving Lusamon.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:25.450
That spoiled little brat tried to destroy us,

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.330
but thanks to Engler, we're on our way to the moon.

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:30.000
I only hope there's still time to save

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.840
Save our world.

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:37.360
The third moon that orbits the digital world is usually covered with yellow-colored sand,

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:43.160
