00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:49.780
Isabella Luna!

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:53.680
Ditto me on that, Z. It's kind of like a slice of heaven.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:57.080
Knock it off, JP. We're not anywhere near heaven just yet.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:02:00.000
Huh? I just meant it's nice.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:14.200
- No, I'm just a spirit only.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:18.070
- Bitchy World's had it.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:21.360
It looks in really bad shape.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:22.440
- Got wiped out.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.120
- Guess it's really over.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:26.300
- No, no it's not.

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.800
- How can you say that, Takuya?

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:30.000
