00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.320
We can't give up.

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:36.460
Winners never quit, and if we quit, we'll never win.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.780
But Takuya, the world we did our best to protect

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:40.270
doesn't even exist.

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:41.410
- It's not that we're quitting,

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:42.910
but there's nothing for us to do here

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.290
and no way left to do it.

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:47.370
- Hello, have you forgotten that we're all Digimon?

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.490
- That's the spirit.

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:50.320
- Yeah.

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:05.070
