00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.020
us in your quest you promised us that we would rule earth but without the key we

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:38.290
cannot enter it and begin our reign you swore that if we destroyed the digital

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:42.370
world and revived you the key would be ours I don't need you to remind me I

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:47.660
know what I said yes but perhaps Lord Lucy mom

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:58.100
but first I must destroy them now get to that moon and do your job

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:04.220
