00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:07.120
How can you doubt my word, Crusader-mon?

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:12.000
If I didn't have the key, and if I wasn't going to give it to you, I would have already said so.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:16.360
