00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:25.510
But I will not be frozen by your fears.

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:28.630
We must obey Lord Lucimon unequivocally.

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.000
We fear nothing in serving

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:39.180
you my lord nothing but our own failure forgive me my doubts sire now that you are of one mind

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:50.210
destroy them we will what are those floating things oh looks like someone's taking a bubble bath

00:04:50.210 --> 00:05:00.000
oh oh good oh it says come back wow check it out

