Oh my God!

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:26.400
These Digimon must have just hatched!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:30.000
Yeah, I bet you're right!

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:36.100
so great to see you guys you know sometimes you're not really sure if your

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:39.600
