Slotman, it's nice to meet you.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:15.240
And my name is Salomon, so tell us who you are.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:35.510
It looks like time has brought these three full circle.

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:40.870
Patamon is Serafimon, Lotmon is Terubimon, and Salomon is Ofanimon.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:43.860
After everything they went through, they've forgiven each other.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:47.190
Gee, I guess when they were reborn, it must have purified them.

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:50.770
I don't know, Z. Maybe they became pure, and that's why they were reborn.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:53.080
Hmm. What do you think?

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.360
Who knows?

00:06:56.360 --> 00:07:00.000
I don't think it really matters how this happened. Just as long as

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.760
