00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:12.410
We have to make sure that happens.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:21.370
Do to bring it all back.

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:22.350
Just try.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:24.330
Yeah, we can't give up hope.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.110
