00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.360
What is this about?

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.360
Ah, what the heck.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:28.120
The game to determine your future has begun.

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:29.120
Yeah.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:30.000
Boy, how are you?

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:34.990
i've been in the game it became a more serious game when i found out who i really was finding

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:40.090
out you're not just a kid but a digimon gave me all kinds of feelings feelings of power and

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:44.810
responsibility but most of all it gave me the sense that what i did really could affect things

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:50.250
at first it was kind of fun i mean it was really exciting to be exploring the digital world

