00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.800
its forms must be stopped

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:55.510
oh what have you done it's too strong I have no choice

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:04.710
We've always tried to stop evil from running wild.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:08.850
I've faced this decision before, but I always return to fight for what's right.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.110
Well, I didn't think I'd see you again.

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.050
Trailmon, you have to take me back!

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:17.270
