00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.250
Yeah, that's right!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.250
When we combine all of our strength, we can't be beat!

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:58.720
So let's do it!

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.000
Mmm!

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:07.140
We have got to look at this as the final battle. There's no backing down!

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:11.550
Those royal creeps may think we're just kids to be bullied, but we're Digimon!

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:17.260
We're World 2 and we're not gonna let them win!

